# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Soulcare — Parent Repository .gitignore
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# This repo (Soulcare/) is LOCAL ONLY — no remote is configured.
# This .gitignore is a safety net: even if a remote is ever accidentally
# added, none of these private files can be pushed.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Documentation & internal notes (local only) ───────
_docs/
PRD
SEO
user_flow

# ─── Design assets & reference materials ───────────────
_design_assets/

# ─── Raw media files (too large / private) ─────────────
*.mp4
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.jfif
*.png
*.pdf

# ─── Web project sensitive files ───────────────────────
web/.env
web/.env.*
web/soulcare.db
web/*.db
web/*.db-journal
web/.next/
web/node_modules/

# ─── OS / editor junk ──────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
